rem How Many Reversible Numbers
rem https://projecteuler.net/problem=145
rem Count the n below ten to the Digits
rem where n plus its reverse has only
rem odd digits, n and n mod 10 nonzero

use sequences
use io
use cli

arg Digits integer = 9

rem By digit count k, summing pairs of
rem digits with odd sums: even k gives
rem 20 30^(k/2 - 1). Odd k works only
rem for k = 3 mod 4: 100 500^((k-3)/4).
K = 1 to Digits array
Half' = (K // 2 - 1) max 0
Quad' = ((K - 3) // 4) max 0
Even' = 20 * 30 ** Half
Odd' = 100 * 500 ** Quad
Odd' = K mod 4 equal 3 choose Odd 0
Ways' = K mod 2 equal 0 choose Even Odd
Answer = Ways sum
Answer print
